  "description": "Building works including alterations to the rear elevation; addition of solar panels on existing dormer extension.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed works are not considered permitted development as they fail to meet the criteria of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) Schedule 2,&amp;nbsp;Part 1, Class A,&amp;nbsp; A.3 (a), as it would contain materials substantially different from the existing. ",
    "The proposed works are not considered to be permitted development as the applicant has failed to provide sufficient information to ensure that the proposed solar panels would not exceed the maximum height allowed within Part 1, Class C, C.1 (b), (c) and (d) and Part 14, Class A, A.1 (ba) and A.2 (a) and (b) of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended). "
